 "sentences": [
  "Anna Blackburne built her own natural history museum.",
  "She collected insects, shells, minerals, and birds.",
  "She even taught herself Latin to read Carl Linnaeus’s book.",
  "Her father owned hothouses for exotic plants at their home.",
  "She studied entomology with naturalist Johann Reinhold Forster.",
  "Her brother sent her bird specimens from New York.",
  "She even sent her own collections directly to Linnaeus."
